        "id": 23721,
        "name": "mccann98",
        "username": "mccann98",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/8c91f0/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-10-29T18:02:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ok.  Let me ask this.  I was playing last night as Bunker.  If Bunker has more than one equipment card in play at a time, such as grenade launcher and gatling gun, can he use all of them or can only use one of them?</p>\n<p>Thanks,<br>\nMike</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:57:42.908Z",
