      {
        "id": 23723,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-10-29T18:07:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There is no limit on the amount of cards in play (with the exception of a card with the “Limited” keyword, in which case only one card with that title is allowed on the table).  A player however is given only one power to use on his turn.  There are methods available to obtain the ability to use additional powers, and, in that case, that player may not use the same power from the same card twice.  If the ability listed on the card does not state “Power” then it is not limited in the way I described, and is instead automatic.</p>",
